# /etc/inittab of the Alpine image (busybox init, the minirootfs's
# /sbin/init): the kw layer's rc, welcome and net (/usr/lib/kw/, from the
# base), the qemu-user binfmt formats, a root shell on hvc0 and kwtty serve
# (respawned), the layer's shutdown at poweroff and reboot.

# unkernel: a root shell on the console, and kwtty for the host's
# terminal sessions over vsock (it sleeps when there is no vsock device).
::sysinit:/usr/lib/kw/rc
::sysinit:/usr/lib/kw/welcome
::sysinit:/usr/lib/kw/net
::sysinit:/etc/kw-binfmt.sh
hvc0::respawn:-/bin/sh
::respawn:/usr/bin/kwtty serve
::ctrlaltdel:/sbin/reboot
::shutdown:/usr/lib/kw/shutdown
